  "releaseNotes": "NextGenSoftware.OASIS.API.Providers.FantomOASIS v2.0.5\n\nConnects the OASIS to Fantom -- EVM-compatible DAG blockchain using Lachesis aBFT consensus for near-instant 1-second finality and near-zero fees. Stores OASIS holons, avatars, and tokens on Fantom Opera. Part of the OASIS HOT-Swappable Provider Architecture. Ecosystem: https://oasisomniverse.one\n\nWhat's new since v2.0.4\n- Add explicit Fantom canonical-at-read CQL and verified local demo (16018cf)\n- Fix Fantom V2 query authority and encryption chain identity (e929c82)\n- MOVING DOCS AROUND (32a8004)\n\nFull changelog\nhttps://github.com/NextGenSoftwareUK/OASIS/commits/master/Providers/Blockchain/NextGenSoftware.OASIS.API.Providers.FantomOASIS",
